      <p class="md-bs-card__hint">{{t "%app_name% works great with YouTube and TarHeel Reader links!" key="youtube_and_tarheel_reader_compatible"}}</p>

      {{!-- Video links (YouTube): resource_from_url derives model.video. "Show video in
            a popup" toggles model.video.popup — ON opens an in-app video pane in speak
            mode (app_state.launch_url → inline-video), OFF opens the link in a browser
            tab. The preview iframe carries id="link_video_preview" so the track_video
